{"id":"formularios-proyecto-guiado-paso-a-paso","title":"Formularios - Proyecto guiado paso a paso","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","html","css","javascript"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"},{"depth":3,"text":"Estructura HTML (index.html)","id":"estructura-html-index-html"},{"depth":3,"text":"Estilos CSS (styles.css)","id":"estilos-css-styles-css"},{"depth":3,"text":"Lógica JavaScript (app.js)","id":"logica-javascript-app-js"}],"readingMins":2,"codeBlocks":3,"words":368,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Un proyecto integrador completo de formulario de inscripción que unifica la estructura semántica de HTML5, las hojas de estilo y pseudo-clases CSS para el feedback de estado interactivo, y la programación en JavaScript para controlar el envío de datos y la validación en el cliente.</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><h3 id=\"estructura-html-index-html\" class=\"note__h\">Estructura HTML (<code>index.html</code>)</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;formInscripcion&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">action</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;/registrar&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">method</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;POST&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;formulario&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>Inscripción al Curso<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  \n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;grupo-campo&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Nombre Completo *<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Juan Pérez&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">minlength</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;3&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;error-msg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;errorNombre&quot;</span>&gt;</span>El nombre es obligatorio y debe tener mínimo 3 letras.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;grupo-campo&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Correo Electrónico *<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;juan@ejemplo.com&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;error-msg&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;errorEmail&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Por favor, introduce un correo electrónico válido.<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;grupo-campo&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;curso&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Selecciona Curso *<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">select</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;curso&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;curso&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>&gt;</span>-- Elige un curso --<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;html&quot;</span>&gt;</span>HTML y CSS Avanzado<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;js&quot;</span>&gt;</span>JavaScript Moderno<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">select</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;grupo-checkbox&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;checkbox&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;terminos&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;terminos&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;terminos&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Acepto los términos y condiciones de inscripción *<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;submit&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btn-enviar&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Inscribirse ahora<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"estilos-css-styles-css\" class=\"note__h\">Estilos CSS (<code>styles.css</code>)</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\">* { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">box-sizing</span>: border-box; }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.formulario</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">max-width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">450px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">30px</span> auto;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">30px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-radius</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">12px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">box-shadow</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">4px</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">20px</span> <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">rgba</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.1</span>);\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-family</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;</span>, system-ui, sans-serif;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#fff</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-bottom</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">20px</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">label</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">display</span>: block;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-bottom</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">6px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-weight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">600</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#333</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">input</span>, <span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">select</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1px</span> solid <span class=\"hljs-number\">#ccc</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-radius</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">6px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">transition</span>: border-color <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.25s</span> ease;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">input</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-pseudo\">:focus</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#1f4e79</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">outline</span>: none;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* Manejo de errores visuales */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.error-msg</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">display</span>: none;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.8em</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#d9534f</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">margin-top</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">4px</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.con-error</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">input</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#d9534f</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#fdf2f2</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.grupo-campo</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.con-error</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.error-msg</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">display</span>: block;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.btn-enviar</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">width</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">100%</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">padding</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">12px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#1f4e79</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: white;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: none;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-radius</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">6px</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1em</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">cursor</span>: pointer;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">transition</span>: background-color <span class=\"hljs-number\">0.2s</span> ease;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.btn-enviar</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-pseudo\">:hover</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">background-color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">#5b9bd5</span>;\n}</code></pre></div><h3 id=\"logica-javascript-app-js\" class=\"note__h\">Lógica JavaScript (<code>app.js</code>)</h3><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">javascript</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> form = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;formInscripcion&#x27;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> nombre = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;nombre&#x27;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> email = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;email&#x27;</span>);\n\nform.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;submit&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">e</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">let</span> errores = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">false</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Validar Nombre</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (nombre.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">trim</span>().<span class=\"hljs-property\">length</span> &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>) {\n    nombre.<span class=\"hljs-property\">parentElement</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">add</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;con-error&#x27;</span>);\n    errores = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n    nombre.<span class=\"hljs-property\">parentElement</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">remove</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;con-error&#x27;</span>);\n  }\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Validar Email</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!email.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">includes</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@&#x27;</span>)) {\n    email.<span class=\"hljs-property\">parentElement</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">add</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;con-error&#x27;</span>);\n    errores = <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>;\n  } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> {\n    email.<span class=\"hljs-property\">parentElement</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">classList</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">remove</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;con-error&#x27;</span>);\n  }\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (errores) {\n    e.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preventDefault</span>(); <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Detener envío si hay errores</span>\n  }\n});</code></pre></div>"}